WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.140
Across much of Europe,
fewer people are baptised,

2
00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.040
married in church, or attend each week.

3
00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.070
Yet books defending faith still sell.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.270
Two writers who defend
it were born in Belfast.

5
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:16.890
Meanwhile, scandals and disagreements
have shaken trust in church leaders.

6
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:19.670
So what is happening to belief today?

7
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:22.800
In this mission, you'll compare
the ways churches are led,

8
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:25.140
and what gives a leader authority.

9
00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:28.070
Then you'll test the
idea of secularisation,

10
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.840
and meet three thinkers: C.

11
00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:30.040
S.

12
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.490
Lewis, Alister McGrath and Karl Rahner.

13
00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:37.560
Your mission: weigh up what is
really happening to belief today.
